add table ip ferm
delete table ip ferm
add table ip ferm
add chain ip ferm INPUT { type filter hook input priority 0; }
add rule ip ferm INPUT meta l4proto tcp osf name "Linux" accept
add rule ip ferm INPUT meta l4proto tcp osf name "Windows" accept
add rule ip ferm INPUT meta l4proto tcp osf ttl loose name "Windows" drop
add rule ip ferm INPUT meta l4proto tcp osf ttl skip name "FreeBSD" drop
add rule ip ferm INPUT meta l4proto tcp osf name != "Linux" drop
